'''''Rhododendron kanehirai''''' is a species of [[plant]] in the family [[Ericaceae]]. It was originally [[Endemism|endemic]] to [[Taiwan]]. It has become [[extinct]] in the wild, though it still exists in cultivated form.<ref name="iucn status 16 November 2021" />

Botanic collections include those at [[Logan Botanic Garden]] where the Rhododendron is grown for preservation and display.<ref name="RBGE">{{cite web | title=Watch: Logan Botanic Garden | website=Royal Botanic Garden Edinburgh | url=https://www.rbge.org.uk/visit/logan-botanic-garden/watch-logan-botanic-garden/ | access-date=2024-08-27}}</ref>

